     A*==========================================================
     A* SCSPRT1 - SAMPLE SCS PRINTER FILE (DDS)
     A* Customer Master Listing - a broad, mutually-compatible
     A* set of SCS-valid DDS keywords: INDARA, PRTQLTY, SKIPB,
     A* SPACEB, DRAWER, DFT (implicit/explicit), DATE, TIME,
     A* PAGNBR, EDTCDE, EDTWRD, UNDERLINE, COLOR, DATFMT, DATSEP,
     A* TIMFMT, TIMSEP.
     A* Create with:
     A*   CRTPRTF FILE(MYLIB/SCSPRT1) SRCFILE(MYLIB/QDDSSRC) +
     A*           SRCMBR(SCSPRT1) DEVTYPE(*SCS) PAGESIZE(66 132)
     A*==========================================================
     A*
     A* FILE-LEVEL KEYWORDS
     A                                      INDARA
     A                                      PRTQLTY(*STD)
     A*
     A* HEADER RECORD FORMAT
     A* (record has SKIPB -> fields use position-only placement plus
     A* field-level SPACEB to advance to a new print line)
     A          R HDRREC                    SKIPB(1) DRAWER(1)
     A                                     2'ABC MANUFACTURING CO.'
     A                                    98'PAGE'
     A                                    +2PAGNBR EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                     2SPACEB(1) 'CUSTOMER MASTER LISTING'
     A                                    98DATE EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                    92SPACEB(1) 'TIME:'
     A                                    +1TIME
     A                                     2SPACEB(2) 'CUST NO' UNDERLINE
     A                                    12'CUSTOMER NAME' UNDERLINE
     A                                    40'ORDER DATE' UNDERLINE
     A                                    58'AMOUNT DUE' UNDERLINE
     A                                    75'ST' UNDERLINE
     A*
     A* DETAIL RECORD FORMAT
     A          R DTLREC                    SPACEB(1)
     A            CUSTNO         6S 0      2
     A            CUSTNAME      25A       +2
     A            ORDDATE         L       +2DATFMT(*ISO) DATSEP('-')
     A            ORDTIME         T       +1TIMFMT(*USA) TIMSEP(':')
     A            AMOUNT         7S 2     +2EDTWRD('  ,   .  CR')
     A            CUSTSTAT       1A       +2DFT('A') COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A* TOTAL RECORD FORMAT
     A          R TOTREC                    SKIPB(2)
     A                                    30'TOTAL AMOUNT DUE . . . . :'
     A            TOTAMT         9S 2     +1EDTCDE(J)
